[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4620.07, "timestamp": "01:17:00", "text": "うん。 なぜじっと立っているのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4622.229, "timestamp": "01:17:02", "text": "私たちは雑談でもする。 あなたはチャットをしない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4625.189, "timestamp": "01:17:05", "text": "いや、いや、いや。 私はただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4628.149, "timestamp": "01:17:08", "text": "ここにいるだけです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4630.31, "timestamp": "01:17:10", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4632.709, "timestamp": "01:17:12", "text": "彼女と1対1で戦わないで。 良くない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4634.149, "timestamp": "01:17:14", "text": "チームの支持を得られない。 後ろも見てください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4641.35, "timestamp": "01:17:21", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4661.83, "timestamp": "01:17:41", "text": "彼は本当に落ちぶれた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4664.31, "timestamp": "01:17:44", "text": "ええと、あなたに何があったのかは分かりません。   どうしたの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4665.83, "timestamp": "01:17:45", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4670.39, "timestamp": "01:17:50", "text": "何？ 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4671.669, "timestamp": "01:17:51", "text": "誰に死んだのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4674.47, "timestamp": "01:17:54", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4676.709, "timestamp": "01:17:56", "text": "誰にとって究極の存在なの？ 誰の究極体は誰のもの？  BPが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4677.189, "timestamp": "01:17:57", "text": "あなたの後ろにいます。 ちなみに、その"}]